emocratic narrows the gap but does not come close to closing it.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0216, "margin": -12.87}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0168, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0143, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0384, "margin": -12.5}]}